cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Sensible Heat Storage (SHS) Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sathiya Satchi"
    given-names: "Christopher"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6834-5799"
    affiliation: "CIIAE – Iberian Energy Storage Research Center, Cáceres, Spain"
repository-code: "https://github.com/christophersathya-bit/sensible-heat-storage"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Datasets and visualizations of sensible heat storage media from 0 °C to about
  2000 °C: 15 storage media with temperature range, density, specific heat,
  thermal conductivity, approximate cost, limiting mechanism and references,
  plus 3,000 synthetic storage cases (stored energy, standby heat loss,
  efficiency) generated by the included scripts.
keywords:
  - sensible heat storage
  - thermal energy storage
  - molten salt
  - concentrated solar power
  - dataset
